# Optional mission-brief endpoint (Cloudflare Worker in cloudflare/brief-worker).
#
# The dashboard POSTs { facts } to this URL and expects { text }.
# The URL is public; never put a provider key in a VITE_* variable.
# Leave unset to use Chrome's built-in LanguageModel when available, or the
# facts-only template fallback otherwise.
VITE_BRIEF_ENDPOINT=
